              "E084",
              "E088",
              "E104"
            ],
            "likely_direction": "harms_ruler",
            "interpretation_effect": "This likely sharpens the negative side of the record, but it does not create the underlying administrative retaliation or network protection. It widened the plausible range slightly upward."
